cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software or its results, please cite the preprint listed
  under preferred-citation.
title: "AGENTRUN"
abstract: >-
  QLoRA fine-tuning of Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct for MCP-based multi-tool use,
  evaluated on a fixed 23-task benchmark, with a controlled parser-only
  ablation (E4) separating serving-layer parser effects from adapter effects.
type: software
authors:
